---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout>
  <section class="hero home-hero">
    <div class="home-hero-copy">
      <div class="eyebrow">Field notes in public</div>
      <h1>Becoming a Forward Deployed Engineer.</h1>
      <p class="lede">I’m documenting my journey toward FDE roles through sample customer cases, job posting research, portfolio projects, and reflections on the application process in public.</p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a class="button" href="/sample-cases/">Explore sample cases</a>
        <a class="button secondary" href="/framework/">See the framework</a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <aside class="field-map" aria-label="FDE preparation map">
      <div class="map-window">
        <div class="map-bar"><span></span><span></span><span></span></div>
        <div class="map-canvas">
          <div class="map-node request">
            <small>01</small>
            <strong>Request</strong>
            <span>messy customer ask</span>
          </div>
          <div class="map-node workflow">
            <small>02</small>
            <strong>Workflow</strong>
            <span>real operating path</span>
          </div>
          <div class="map-node trust">
            <small>03</small>
            <strong>Trust</strong>
            <span>review + safety boundary</span>
          </div>
          <div class="map-node deploy">
            <small>04</small>
            <strong>Deploy</strong>
            <span>small useful system</span>
          </div>
          <svg class="map-lines" viewBox="0 0 520 360" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M122 95 C210 40 300 45 383 100" />
            <path d="M392 135 C430 205 350 250 265 250" />
            <path d="M235 250 C155 250 105 212 106 151" />
            <path class="accent-line" d="M142 124 C222 158 292 168 368 132" />
          </svg>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="signal-strip" aria-label="Preparation signals">
        <span>Cases</span>
        <span>Research</span>
        <span>Portfolio</span>
        <span>Applications</span>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </section>

  <section class="visual-pillar-grid" aria-label="Content pillars">
    <article class="pillar-card journal">
      <div class="pillar-visual mini-journal" aria-hidden="true">
        <span></span><span></span><span></span>
      </div>
      <small>01</small>
      <h3>Application Journal</h3>
      <p>Notes from real preparation work: resume rewrites, applications, weekly progress, and retrospectives.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="pillar-card cases">
      <div class="pillar-visual mini-case" aria-hidden="true">
        <span>Ask</span><i></i><span>MVP</span>
      </div>
      <small>02</small>
      <h3>Sample Cases</h3>
      <p>Fictional customer requests translated into questions, MVP architecture, risks, and deployment plans.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="pillar-card research">
      <div class="pillar-visual mini-radar" aria-hidden="true">
        <span></span><span></span><span></span>
      </div>
      <small>03</small>
      <h3>FDE Research</h3>
      <p>What the role requires, how it differs from adjacent roles, and why AI companies care about deployment.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="pillar-card portfolio">
      <div class="pillar-visual mini-stack" aria-hidden="true">
        <span></span><span></span><span></span>
      </div>
      <small>04</small>
      <h3>Portfolio Projects</h3>
      <p>Small deployed demos that show ambiguous problem solving, customer context, and clear communication.</p>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="section prep-loop-section">
    <div>
      <p class="kicker">Starting point</p>
      <h2>This is not expert advice yet. It is a public preparation loop.</h2>
      <p class="lede">The goal is to connect every piece of content to a real action: reading job postings, improving application materials, building demos, or learning from outcomes.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="loop-diagram" aria-label="Public preparation loop">
      <div><strong>Read</strong><span>job posts</span></div>
      <div><strong>Frame</strong><span>case problems</span></div>
      <div><strong>Build</strong><span>small demos</span></div>
      <div><strong>Reflect</strong><span>application notes</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
